--- discord ---
### Appeals
Members can appeal eligible cases once, from Quack's DM or the dashboard, even after a ban. Use </setup:1004> to choose where new appeals appear. Moderators can also use </appeals:1002> or the dashboard. Accepting an appeal voids the case so it stops counting. Open the case to check whether its timeout or ban was removed.
buttons: [Open the dashboard](https://quack.example/guilds/111/cases/12)
--- plain ---
Appeals
Members can appeal eligible cases once, from Quack's DM or the dashboard, even after a ban. Use /setup to choose where new appeals appear. Moderators can also use /appeals or the dashboard. Accepting an appeal voids the case so it stops counting. Open the case to check whether its timeout or ban was removed.
